        <source>was deleted because no data could be assigned to it!</source>
        <target>被刪除，因為沒有資料可以指派給它！</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="s8192fafe6f0cc0bb">
        <source>An input layer is a layer that just takes data provided from outside the network and passes it on to the next layer(s)</source>
        <target>輸入層是只接收網路外部提供的資料，並將其傳遞至下一層的層。</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="s0e36885f01f95cc8">
        <source>A dense layer, also called fully-connected layer, is a layer whose inside neurons connect to every neuron in the preceding layer.</source>
        <target>密集層 (dense layer) 也稱為全連結層 (fully-connected layer)，是指內部的神經元與前一層的每個神經元相連的層。</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="s3310986378624a28">
        <source>The selected layer can not be duplicated! Only a single output layer is currently supported!</source>
        <target>選取的圖層無法重複！目前只支援單一輸出層！</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sdc95be9d922008e7">
        <source>An output layer in this simulation is just a normal dense layer, additionally equipped with the ability to output the incoming data out of the network.</source>
        <target>在這個模擬中，輸出層只是一般的密集層，另外還具備將輸入的資料輸出網路的能力。</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sa5982fd2e05ee92d">
        <source>Since the purpose if this layer is to output a classifiction, we should combine it with a softmax activation function in order to provide a probability distribution.</source>
        <target>由於這一層的目的是輸出分類，因此我們應該結合 softmax 啟動函數，以提供一個概率分布。</target>
      </trans-unit>
